# Johto's Victory Road and Tohjo Falls' hidden room: HeartGold's SEQ_GS_D_CHAMPROAD, and this game a song of its own:
# a tense trumpet in C minor over driving string eighths, a pushing bass and a steady drum, the last climb before the
# League. A cave plays the same by day and night. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J10, part b).
